    {"text": "Heavy, fleshy jowls wobbled as he spoke.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A broad, flat forehead sloped back to his hairline.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Her fine-boned, elfin face tilted towards the light.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "His craggy, weathered profile stood out against the window.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Her soft, rounded chin dimpled when she smiled.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Her thin, pinched features had sharpened with the years.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "He clenched his jaw and said nothing.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Dark curls framed her face.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He thrust out his chin and dared them to argue.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Her plump, placid face softened as she listened.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "In the firelight his face was all hard, chiselled planes.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "His features hardened into a mask.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Rage twisted his face until his own mother would not have known him.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "She had a fierce, bony face, all angles, like a hawk's.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Grief had hollowed her temples and sagged the skin along her jaw.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The contours of his face were those of a much older man.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
